WEBVTT

00:06:59.983 --> 00:07:02.819
I would kill for it to have
a snooze button.

00:07:04.554 --> 00:07:05.889
But it doesn't.

00:07:05.922 --> 00:07:08.925
So I drag myself out of bed,

00:07:08.959 --> 00:07:13.296
drink juice and deal with that beeping
until my blood sugar comes up.

00:07:15.532 --> 00:07:16.700
This device saves me

00:07:16.733 --> 00:07:19.636
because I can't detect the signs
of low blood sugar,

00:07:19.636 --> 00:07:21.905
the shaking, the world feeling fuzzy,

00:07:21.905 --> 00:07:25.608
the feeling of a body
that's no longer mine

00:07:25.608 --> 00:07:27.010
when I'm asleep.

00:07:28.244 --> 00:07:31.681
And if I were to drop too low,